Here is a complete HTML file that recreates a pixel-perfect Space Invaders arcade game, based on the original 1978 Taito cabinet.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Space Invaders – 1978 Taito</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      background: #111;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    .cabinet {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      border: 6px solid #e2e2e2;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px 30px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px #ff3f3f88, inset 0 0 20px #0000ff55;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .cabinet-title {
      color: #ff5e5e;
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px #ff0000, 2px 2px 0 #000;
      font-size: 28px;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
